text:
@AppleSupport My Smart Keyboard keeps disconnecting from my iPad Pro (10.5). Like 2-3 per day. Restarting is the only sure way to fix it.

I haven’t been able to find any Apple Support docs to fix this. Could you point me in the right direction please?

Thx.

@247087 We want to help you with this issue. We recommend that you back up your device and follow the steps that we offer on our article here: https://t.co/osZOKKTalm

This article will walk you through backing up your device: 
https://t.co/4f8hwT5to6

@249930 Thanks for bringing this issue to our attention. Follow the steps in this article and let us know how it goes. 

