@765669 If you are unable to enter the password, you will need to put the device into recovery mode to be able to access it again. This article has a complete walkthrough:
https://t.co/F1QfwW1u1N
It is worth noting, for the protection of your data, this will clear your data.

@814255 We can help get you back up and going with downloading apps. 

Since you noticed this issue, have you powered your device off fully, and then back on? Let us know if that resolves the issue. 

If not, let us know what device you're using and the OS version.
